q{Shadowing is <strong>learning in silence with declared intent</strong>: say what you are watching for, capture quietly, debrief in one page. Pairing is <strong>being a good passenger</strong>: navigator questions, not back-seat driving. Both end with <strong>"leave the seat better"</strong> — a note, a doc fix, something returned.},
q{旁听是<strong>带声明意图的静默学习</strong>：说出你在观察什么、安静记录、一页纸复盘。结Pair是<strong>做好乘客</strong>：领航员的提问，而不是后座驾驶。两者都以<strong>"留下点什么"</strong>收尾——一条笔记、一处文档修复，某种归还。},
