{ t => 'The trace email', p => 'Draft your next follow-up: delivered (with attachment), promised (with date), protocol (the standing rule for the relationship). Three sentences.', a => q{The protocol sentence is the compounding one: "next time something in my lane reaches you, it arrives with context" — say it once and the relationship has a rule. Rules outlive calendars.} },
{ t => 'Find your Miguel', p => 'For your current biggest recurring friction (access, approvals, data), write the two-sentence coffee invite to the person who owns it — artifact named, asks sized.', a => q{Model: "Hi Miguel — I own the churn dashboard and my access requests keep landing on your desk without context. Could I bring you the routing map section on data contracts, plus two questions on which forms actually move? Fifteen minutes, whenever suits."} },
