['The volunteered conditional', q{<em>"I will build it if the room wants it."</em> — first conditional + volunteered labour: <strong>I will X if the room wants Y.</strong> The grammar keeps the proposal humble (the room decides) while the volunteering is unconditional (you are already committed to the build if wanted). Priced + volunteered is the strongest proposal shape a retro can receive.}, q{"I will build it if the room wants it."——第一类条件句 + 自愿劳动：<strong>I will X if the room wants Y.</strong> 语法保持谦逊（房间决定），自愿是无条件的（如果需要，你已承诺动手）。有定价 + 自愿承担，是回顾会能收到的最强提案形态。}],
